What is process- 
              -process is a program in execution that contains one or more threads. 
              -a process is a program that currently executing(running).
              -eg. chrome browser, spotify, etc.

What is Thread - 
              - thread is a small unit of execution inside a process.
              -eg. chrome tabs,  

MultiThreading - 
              -MultiThreading means running multiple tasks at the same time inside a one program
              -eg. mobile phone 

        use cases- 
                web applications
                web servers


to perform the MultiThreading the method name must be run, we can not change/ use another name for method 
to execute it with different method.


